@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam shadowing true
autonumber "<b>[00]</b>"

title **BIỂU ĐỒ TUẦN TỰ UC01: XEM TRANG CHỦ & DANH MỤC BÀI VIẾT**

actor "Người dùng\n(Guest / Reader)" as User #E0F2FE
participant "Trình duyệt Web\n(Browser Client)" as Client #BAE6FD
participant "blog-npm\n(Nginx Gateway :443)" as NPM #93C5FD
participant "blog-wordpress\n(WordPress Core / Astra)" as WP #DBEAFE
database "blog-mysql\n(MySQL 8.0 InnoDB)" as DB #FED7AA
participant "blog-promtail\n(Log Collector)" as Promtail #D1FAE5

User -> Client : Truy cập https://localhost/ hoặc /category/{slug}
activate Client
Client -> NPM : HTTPS GET / (TLS 1.3)
activate NPM
NPM -> NPM : Kiểm tra WAF (block-exploits.conf)\nGiải mã SSL Termination
NPM -> WP : Reverse Proxy HTTP GET :80 (blog_frontend_net)
activate WP
WP -> WP : Phân tích URL Rewrite (WP_Query parse_request)
WP -> DB : SELECT * FROM wp_posts\nJOIN wp_term_relationships ON ...\nWHERE post_status = publish\nORDER BY post_date DESC LIMIT 10\n(Mạng nội bộ blog_backend_net)
activate DB
DB --> WP : Trả về tập danh sách bài viết & chuyên mục
deactivate DB
WP -> WP : Nạp Theme Astra + Hook Plugin lyxlab-hero\nRender mã HTML hoàn chỉnh
WP --> NPM : HTTP 200 OK (Content-Type: text/html)
deactivate WP
NPM -> Promtail : Ghi log truy cập 200 OK (/data/logs/proxy-host-1_access.log)
NPM --> Client : Trả về trang HTML kèm Asset (CSS, JS, Fonts)
deactivate NPM
Client -> Client : Parse DOM, nạp ảnh từ volume wp_data
Client --> User : Hiển thị giao diện Trang chủ / Danh mục LyxLab
deactivate Client
@enduml